  "published": "2026-03-31T12:35:25.33Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.9 - User-Agent Identification\n\n**Improvements:**\n- User-Agent header now includes SDK name and version (ForSign.Sdk/2.0.9) for better API observability\n\nVersion 2.0.8 - Bug Fixes and Validations\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- Fixed: GetMemberAttachmentsAsync failed with JsonSerializationException due to incorrect response deserialization (API returns wrapped object, SDK expected raw array)\n- Fixed: Decimal coordinates like \"50.5%\" threw ArgumentException in pt-BR locale due to culture-sensitive float parsing\n- Fixed: AddFileFromUrlAsync silently accepted HTTP error responses (404, 500) and uploaded invalid content as PDF\n\n**Validations:**\n- Form field height minimum enforced at 2% — values below cause rendering issues in signed documents\n- Duplicate form fields (same name and type per member) are now rejected with a clear error message\n\nFor full documentation, visit: https://docs.forsign.digital",
